# The game's own files, bundled as they are: the package reads them byte for
# byte (the SLK and TXT tables, common.j, blizzard.j, common.ai,
# TriggerData.txt), and their CRLF line endings are part of those bytes. As
# text they were stored with LF, and only a Windows checkout turned them back
# into the game's files; on Linux and macOS they came out different, and
# every bundled SLK failed its byte-for-byte test.
src/wc3files/w3o/gamedata/** -text
src/wc3files/scripts/gamedata/** -text
src/wc3files/wtg/gamedata/** -text
